{"id":"vod_md_3826","vodId":"3826","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"One Room","name_cn":"One Room","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230831-1/b4ad834189cccbd9e4b604f55edada8b.jpg"},"summary":"花坂结衣（市道真央 配音）是一名十七岁的女子高中生，为了应对即将到来的升学考试，她从家乡搬到了东京，来投奔在这里生活的姐姐。虽然结衣平日看起来有些呆呆的，但实际上却是一个非常乐观和努力的姑娘。桃原奈月（村川梨衣 配音）虽然看上去娇小可爱，却意外的擅长料理家事，每一天都为了哥哥的生活忙东忙西。青岛萌香（三森铃子 配音）一直以来都希望能够成为一名歌手，但真正走上这条道路后她才发现，前往充满了曲折和困难。虽然表面上非常的好胜要强，但萌香实际上却有着非常温柔的一面。和这三个可爱的女孩子一起，夏天开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-31 08:37:23","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/Dxs0OFIH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/t40YLbBA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/YV67OrfQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/BEeNUSi5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/aLTGOFrB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/OGmNxNzT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/kGDeo2YA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/sviA1glm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/QmMJLIYk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/gp7tl3ZV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/VCafZaf6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230828/DokQJdMd/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32:16.675Z"}